            ]
          }
        ],
        "rules": [
          {
            "name": "Loyal Doggo",
            "id": "4ab6-82e0-dd97-73c5",
            "description": "A Robodog Pack may be deployed within 1\" of another friendly model. This friendly model is owner of the Robodogs, to whom they will be fantastically loyal. So long as a Robodog is within 1\" of its owner, roll a Combat dice when any ranged attack is made against the owner. If [ARMOUR] is rolled, the attack must be made against the Robodog instead. In addition, if a Robodog Pack is within 1\" of its owner and a close combat attack is made against them, the Robodogs will defend their owner to the death! Immediately move the Robodog Pack into contact with the attacker. The close combat attack must be made against a Robodog.",
